			"Message": "style(Mountain): Reformat README HTML with self-closing tags\n\nReformat HTML markup across README.md and Binary/README.md to use proper self-closing syntax for void elements (<img>, <source>) and consistent multi-line indentation for table structure.\n\nSplitting inline text and emoji across separate lines improves readability and ensures valid XHTML-style markup.",
