			"Message": "style(Mountain): Compact spacing in generated Vine gRPC code\n\nRemove excess blank lines between struct definitions, enum variants, impl blocks, and match arms in the prost-generated Vine protobuf Rust output. The generated client and server implementations for MountainService and CocoonService are tightened throughout.\n\nThis reduces diff noise from regeneration and improves readability of the generated protocol bindings.",
